From: Anland Hyprland Maintainers
Date: Fri, 8 Aug 2026 10:30:00 +0800
Subject: compat: explicitly convert swipe workspace pointer to bool

Forky's hyprutils makes CSharedPointer boolean conversion explicit. The
workspace swipe gesture returns this pointer from a bool function, so convert
it explicitly.

---
 src/managers/input/UnifiedWorkspaceSwipeGesture.cpp | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

--- a/src/managers/input/UnifiedWorkspaceSwipeGesture.cpp
+++ b/src/managers/input/UnifiedWorkspaceSwipeGesture.cpp
@@ -6,8 +6,8 @@
 #include "InputManager.hpp"
 
 bool CUnifiedWorkspaceSwipeGesture::isGestureInProgress() {
-    return m_workspaceBegin;
+    return static_cast<bool>(m_workspaceBegin);
 }
 
 void CUnifiedWorkspaceSwipeGesture::begin() {